        <region top="405" color="#000000">
          <area collapsed="true">
            <title lang="eng">
              <content>
                <p>Range Check</p>
              </content>
            </title>
          </area>
          <region left="0" top="414" width="764" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
            <text lang="eng" width="764" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
              <content>
            <p style="font-weight: bold; font-family: Arial;">Range check tests: If a value falls within the min/max range then it will return a 1 (True), otherwise it will return 0 (False). The Tol check is used if the value has a tolerance, Abs if it does not.</p>
          </content>
            </text>
          </region>
          <region left="0" top="450" width="671" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
            <math>
              <input>
                <e type="operand">Min</e>
                <e type="operand">Value</e>
                <e type="operand">Tol</e>
                <e type="operand">Max</e>
                <e type="function" args="4">RangeCheck.Tol</e>
                <e type="operand">Value</e>
                <e type="operand">1</e>
                <e type="operand">Tol</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
                <e type="bracket">(</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
                <e type="bracket">(</e>
                <e type="operand">Min</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">≥</e>
                <e type="bracket">(</e>
                <e type="operand">Value</e>
                <e type="operand">1</e>
                <e type="operand">Tol</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
                <e type="bracket">(</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
                <e type="bracket">(</e>
                <e type="operand">Max</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">≤</e>
                <e type="bracket">(</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">&amp;</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
              </input>
            </math>
          </region>
          <region left="0" top="477" width="469" height="30" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
            <math>
              <input>
                <e type="operand">Min</e>
                <e type="operand">Value</e>
                <e type="operand">Max</e>
                <e type="function" args="3">RangeCheck.Abs</e>
                <e type="operand">Value</e>
                <e type="operand">Min</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">≥</e>
                <e type="bracket">(</e>
                <e type="operand">Value</e>
                <e type="operand">Max</e>
                <e type="operator" args="2">≤</e>
