        <region top="1512" color="#000000">
          <area collapsed="true">
            <title lang="eng">
              <content>
                <p>Kalman Filter</p>
              </content>
            </title>
          </area>
          <region left="0" top="1539" width="772" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
            <text lang="eng" width="768" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
              <content>
                <p style="font-weight: bold;">Measurements must be a matrix with 2 columns and n rows. The first column is the measurement and the second column is the uncertainty of the measurement expressed as one standard deviation. The result will be expressed in the same format</p>
              </content>
            </text>
          </region>
