            <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
              <content>
                <p style="font-weight: bold;">This is a function template that YOU define for the relevant parameters surrounding the diode circuit. It accepts a Vf estimate and returns a resultant Id. This new current is used to recalculate the voltage. This cycle continues until the answer is accurate to within the specified tolerance.</p>
              </content>
